title: 'Registrar: retry refused reports'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      `pallet-registrar-relay` keeps a report the transport refuses in `FailedReports`, bounded by
      the new `Config::MaxFailedReports`, and resends it in `on_poll`. Adds `retry_failed_reports`
      to `WeightInfo`.

crates:
  - name: pallet-registrar-relay
    bump: major
